/Type /StructElem
/S /H3
/T (While the original whitepaper focused on transparency and decentralization, this extension recognizes that privacy and data sovereignty are equally vital in the African context. Modern zero-knowledge proof \(ZKP\) technologies allow us to achieve seemingly paradoxical goals: prove the integrity of data or actions without revealing the underlying data. By integrating ZK techniques, Alkebuleum can protect sensitive information \(whether personal data or institutional records\) while still maintaining trust and verifiability on a public ledger.)
/E (While the original whitepaper focused on transparency and decentralization, this extension recognizes that privacy and data sovereignty are equally vital in the African context. Modern zero-knowledge proof \(ZKP\) technologies allow us to achieve seemingly paradoxical goals: prove the integrity of data or actions without revealing the underlying data. By integrating ZK techniques, Alkebuleum can protect sensitive information \(whether personal data or institutional records\) while still maintaining trust and verifiability on a public ledger.)
/Pg 10 0 R
/K [1]
>>
endobj
