/E (On the governance side, the Alkebuleum Foundation will establish the Education & Grants programs and start outreach to regulators. By the end of Phase 1, we aim to have a stable mainnet \(running POSR consensus\) with a growing user base and at least one or two pilot applications demonstrating DID + ZK benefits \(e.g., a simple voting application where votes are cast anonymously via ZK proofs of eligibility\).)
/Pg 24 0 R
/K [0]
>>
endobj
